    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sensory immersion? i don't even want to feel anymore. sensation just feels like noise. everything is just... heavy. i look at the world and i see everyone moving, creating, living, and it just feels like they're all part of a story i was kicked out of. i'm just a mistake in the script. sometimes i think the only thing that would actually make sense, the only thing that would bring any peace to this silence, is if the void just finally finished the job. if it just became... final.",
